       "id": "P62932"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Substrate-recognition component of the SCF (SKP1-CUL1-F-box protein)-type E3 ubiquitin ligase complex. Acts as a muscle-specific negative regulator of IGF1 signaling. Mechanistically, promotes polyubiquitination of IRS1 following its IGF1R-induced tyrosine phosphorylation, leading to IRS1 proteasomal degradation and attenuation of the IRS1/PI3K/AKT pathway in differentiated skeletal muscle. Also mediates IRS1 degradation downstream of STAT3 activation in the context of inflammatory insulin resistance"
    }
   ],
